A pull request was created to resolve it:

PR title: ext_authz: Check for cluster before sending HTTP request
PR description:
Description:
This patch adds a cluster existence checking before sending the HTTP `check` request to the responsible cluster.

Risk Level: Low
Testing: Unit
Docs Changes: N/A
Release Notes: N/A
Fixes #8025

cc. @containscafeine

Signed-off-by: Dhi Aurrahman <dio@tetrate.io>
